<title>UK: Wlm Cook says operating margins to improve.</title>
<headline>Wlm Cook says operating margins to improve.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>William Cook Plc said on Monday that it expected its operating margins for second half to March 1997 to rise to 11.1 percent from 7.3 percent in the first half, as the company continued to urge shareholders to reject a hostile bid from engineering group Triplex.</p>
</text>
